chiarire il loro disaccordo.","fr":"Le professeur qui débat avec Koznychev est venu de Kharkiv pour éclaircir leur désaccord.","es":"El profesor que debate con Koznyshev ha venido de Járkov para aclarar su desacuerdo."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"flensburg","collection":"core","name":"Flensburg (oyster provenance)","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"80e9d014934ee5dbe1afebc61c172ef8468ca5f542627fb9ebe8d10e8707bdc7","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"At the restaurant, Flensburg identifies the oysters offered instead of those from Ostend.","it":"Al ristorante, Flensburg indica le ostriche offerte al posto di quelle di Ostenda.","fr":"Au restaurant, Flensbourg désigne les huîtres proposées à la place de celles d''Ostende.","es":"En el restaurante, Flensburgo identifica las ostras ofrecidas en lugar de las de Ostende."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"ostend","collection":"core","name":"Ostend (oyster provenance)","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"aec9e9983b20e484434eb157ee985a4e346e1f0730c6ffe93d1176bc7fbad274","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The waiter explains that Ostend oysters are unavailable.","it":"Il cameriere spiega che le ostriche di Ostenda non sono disponibili.","fr":"Le serveur explique que les huîtres d''Ostende ne sont pas disponibles.","es":"El camarero explica que no hay ostras de Ostende."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"tver","collection":"core","name":"Tver","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"ede57a25a380bd6b6781bacfedaf0350756dfb74c492ac94f475589935a8446f","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Oblonsky recalls meeting Vronsky at Tver during a recruitment assignment.","it":"Oblonskij ricorda di aver conosciuto Vronskij a Tver'' durante un incarico di reclutamento.","fr":"Oblonski rappelle avoir rencontré Vronski à Tver lors d''une mission de recrutement.","es":"Oblonski recuerda haber conocido a Vronski en Tver durante una misión de reclutamiento."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"nice","collection":"core","name":"Nice","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"5563810a4340d603eceb80df5210b6c2f344d28ba0bcf120cea50af94189faca","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The recollection of a winter in Nice evokes homesickness for the Russian countryside.","it":"Il ricordo di un inverno a Nizza richiama la nostalgia per la campagna russa.","fr":"Le souvenir d''un hiver à Nice évoque la nostalgie de la campagne russe.","es":"El recuerdo de un invierno en Niza evoca la nostalgia del campo ruso."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"babylon","collection":"core","name":"Babylon (comparison)","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"8a9549b4faf1ace5d2e5933f49ee52eab21999fd9dd48c1f191030a5f4e60f1a","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Moscow is teasingly called a corrupt Babylon in conversation with Levin.","it":"Mosca viene scherzosamente paragonata a una Babilonia corrotta nella conversazione con Levin.","fr":"Moscou est malicieusement comparée à une Babylone corrompue dans la conversation avec Lévine.","es":"Moscú es comparada en broma con una Babilonia corrupta en la conversación con Levin."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"switzerland","collection":"core","name":"Switzerland","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"df4501aacc8e3aacbfb3529fc7fa7e2d49eef4ea6eac7e4415770092980c20ae","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Anna compares the happiness of youth to the blue haze over Swiss mountains.","it":"Anna paragona la felicità della giovinezza alla foschia azzurra sui monti svizzeri.","fr":"Anna compare le bonheur de la jeunesse à la brume bleue des montagnes suisses.","es":"Anna compara la felicidad de la juventud con la bruma azul de las montañas suizas."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"kiev","collection":"core","name":"Kiev (Kyiv)","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"2c5875d486ff7f0f3fa0f2fb3ab91a5a65b4e3d3c4a433a84e426282f7434629","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nikolai introduces Kritsky as an old friend from Kyiv.","it":"Nikolaj presenta Krickij come un vecchio amico di Kiev.","fr":"Nikolaï présente Kritski comme un vieil ami de Kyiv.","es":"Nikolái presenta a Kritski como un viejo amigo de Kiev."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"bolshaya-morskaya","collection":"core","name":"Bolshaya Morskaya Street","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"968a62f1de588fd1f19cad6036ba1f0e96b2f7d15478db197ee799ec17bd3668","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Vronsky has left his apartment on Morskaya to his companion Petritsky.","it":"Vronskij ha lasciato l''appartamento sulla Morskaja al compagno Petrickij.","fr":"Vronski a laissé son appartement de la Morskaïa à son camarade Petritski.","es":"Vronski ha dejado su apartamento de Morskaya a su compañero Petritski."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"soden","collection":"core","name":"Soden (Bad Soden am Taunus)","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"fb8e16c47c05df98b6940d49e4a0f9455b95cba724ec3530e84eeed53a615789","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Kitty''s father credits Soden with helping her recover, though he finds the place gloomy.","it":"Il padre di Kitty attribuisce a Soden la sua ripresa, pur trovando triste il luogo.","fr":"Le père de Kitty attribue à Soden son rétablissement, tout en trouvant l''endroit triste.","es":"El padre de Kitty atribuye a Soden su recuperación, aunque encuentra triste el lugar."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"moscow","collection":"core","name":"Moscow","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"b3a17d86bfef8f1998c83e5672468b5d9d8220d7b8062bc477ba9234e680cd4b","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"After returning from Moscow, Anna finds Lydia Ivanovna''s circle intolerably false.","it":"Dopo il ritorno da Mosca, Anna trova insopportabilmente falso il circolo di Lidija Ivanovna.","fr":"Après son retour de Moscou, Anna trouve le cercle de Lydia Ivanovna insupportablement faux.","es":"Tras regresar de Moscú, Anna encuentra insoportablemente falso el círculo de Lidia Ivánovna."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"petersburg","collection":"core","name":"Saint Petersburg","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"5df71e35140b48b9571d4663fce0c18210dedac2e905db166025360107f312ce","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Anna''s Petersburg society is divided into official, pious and fashionable circles.","it":"La società pietroburghese di Anna si divide in circoli ufficiali, devoti e mondani.","fr":"La société pétersbourgeoise d''Anna se partage en cercles officiels, pieux et mondains.","es":"La sociedad petersburguesa de Anna se divide en círculos oficiales, piadosos y mundanos."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"europe","collection":"core","name":"Europe","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"c4777e68f8ffbe95ba819691bb557e08335e883a4ae98f69346e8e97d356bc7b","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"A guest praises Karenin as one of Europe''s exceptional statesmen.","it":"Un''ospite elogia Karenin come uno dei rari grandi uomini di Stato d''Europa.","fr":"Une invitée présente Karénine comme l''un des rares grands hommes d''État d''Europe.","es":"Una invitada elogia a Karenin como uno de los pocos grandes estadistas de Europa."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"krasnoe","collection":"core","name":"Krasnoye Selo and racecourse area","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"fe6643fd900bdba29457fe57a964854e9b23dec46f9106ec95f2c15390e44192","narrat