lo di viaggio sulla Cina e gli chiede di riceverne l''autore.","fr":"Lydia Ivanovna envoie à Karénine une brochure de voyage sur la Chine et lui demande d''en recevoir l''auteur.","es":"Lidia Ivánovna envía a Karenin un folleto de viajes sobre China y le pide que reciba a su autor."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"england","collection":"core","name":"England","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"882f3d1c48e85bcf64b6e18dffae59f4a6351cfc4a20fef1305a9149c85750b2","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"England''s cavalry history is invoked to defend the value and dangers of military racing.","it":"La storia della cavalleria inglese è richiamata per difendere il valore e i rischi delle corse militari.","fr":"L''histoire de la cavalerie anglaise est invoquée pour défendre la valeur et les dangers des courses militaires.","es":"La historia de la caballería inglesa se invoca para defender el valor y los riesgos de las carreras militares."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"paris","collection":"core","name":"Paris","noteHash":"951f6f4b920475ed79173748ceceaa1d","positionSource":"fd011f0c91fbcd453ef2bf4f00c16aeeb733b99c7b6cc5dbb050ff1cf92dfc72","narrativeSource":"9e6a3af469c4744dc9f69d7fc0aab5bc92dacf21e5bfc7a2daa9f62eaa936807","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Kitty''s elegant summer dress has been ordered from Paris.","it":"L''elegante abito estivo di Kitty è stato ordinato a Parigi.","fr":"La robe d''été élégante de Kitty a été commandée à Paris.","es":"El elegante vestido de verano de Kitty ha sido encargado en París."}}},{"book":"anna-karenina","id":"karlsbad","collection":"core","name":"Karlsbad (Karlovy Vary)","noteHash":"951f6f4b